&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16746152" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 18 Jan 2019 10:45:41 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2826462&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16746187" author="nsamelchev" created="Fri, 18 Jan 2019 11:22:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;One of a problem was resolved in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5115&quot; title=&quot;Investigation of failing tests of coordinator node failure &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5115&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5115&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (coordinator failing).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have fixed the test issues: &lt;br/&gt;
1. Client node disconnected issue. Getting retry future can throw &lt;tt&gt;IgniteClientDisconnectedException&lt;/tt&gt;. I wrote the &lt;tt&gt;getRetryFuture&lt;/tt&gt; method and use it in the client future.&lt;br/&gt;
2. the &lt;tt&gt;awaitPartitionMapExchange()&lt;/tt&gt; can throw &quot;Grid is in invalid state - node stopping). I added additional checks for servers stopped.&lt;br/&gt;
3. Redundant code cleanup.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have tested the test locally and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2825701&amp;amp;tab=testsInfo&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Spi&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;on TC&lt;/a&gt; more than 100 times.&lt;br/&gt;
The test can fail with a problem that described in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1758&quot; title=&quot;Clients don&amp;#39;t survive during massive servers shutdown&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1758&quot;&gt;IGNITE-1758&lt;/a&gt; (less 5% fail rate). &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can anyone review the test changes?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752172" author="sergey-chugunov" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 11:23:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NSAmelchev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;NSAmelchev&quot;&gt;NSAmelchev&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I reviewed your change, it looks reasonable for me. All tests from test class are passing locally, so if there are no new failures on TC, please proceed with merging fix to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752426" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 16:52:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
